  "_comment": "Phantom extension, plain ETH send. A self-custodial seed import still runs under a server-side Phantom user id (2de026d0…) that most calls are keyed to. Phantom screens YOUR address (wallet_screen/v1), simulates the full tx on its server, reads and broadcasts through its own RPC proxy, and after sending PUTs the recipient into your account's recent addresses. It also reads the Solana account from the same seed. Real mainnet tx 0xbd62c7bcde422ae6c83f8aeb07812060709e185252b7478761cde6bc2bfeef7f.",
